; adaptive.aura — Aura adaptive eviction supervisor (Iteration 6 moat)
;
; Policy rules (windowed deltas; keep in sync with adaptive_body.aura and the
; inlined tick in server_ffi.aura):
;   1. Ignore windows with fewer than *ad-min-ops* ops (now 40).
;   2. Write-ish + miss spike: sets≥gets AND miss>30% → prefer "lfu"
;   3. Classic write-heavy: sets > gets * 2 → prefer "lfu"
;   4. Read-heavy: gets > sets * 3 AND hit≥50% → prefer "lru"
;   5. Hysteresis: *ad-votes-need* consecutive votes + *ad-cooldown-ms*.
; Joint EVICT|LAYOUT|PIN lives in choose_*.aura / policy_agent (not this FFI file).
;
; Usage:
;   - Unit tests (no FFI): (require "src/redis/adaptive" all:)
;   - server_ffi.aura inlines the same rules: on this Aura rev, mixing many
;     top-level (c-func) binds with (require)/(load) closures makes user
;     procedures inert. See comments in server_ffi.aura.
;
; hot-strategy: wired in policy_agent.aura (Iteration 9) — not this FFI file.

(export adaptive-rules-doc
        adaptive-choose
        adaptive-init!
        adaptive-tick!
        adaptive-swap-count)

(load "src/redis/adaptive_body.aura")
